  unitName: "Mai Shiranui (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 810177
  unitNumber: 8212
  description: A cheerful yet temperamental kunoichi. Mai's investigation into the
    mysterious invitation led her to places and parts unknown. From deserts to swamps,
    mountains to abandoned cities, each discovery only held more questions that she
    could not answer. At last, it was in an abandoned strip-mining facility that
    she finally found the gate mentioned in the invitation. Approaching it, she thought
    she heard the phantom cry of her beloved, and thus leapt in without a second
    thought. It was only when the tendrils of madness started to choke her unwary
    mind that she realized her mistake.
  summonDesc: Time for a real ninja to show you some moves!
  fusionDesc: I'm Japan's number one Kunoichi!<br>(laughter)
  evoDesc: With a body and strength like this,<br>they don't stand a chance!
  element: 1
  rarity: 6
